hadiths[38]{hadithnumber,text}:
"431","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo ek qaum ke maal mein muflis ho jae aur ek aadmi apna maal bi-ainihi dekhe to woh us ka ghair se ziyada haqdar hai."
"432","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo musarra khareede phir agar use wapas kare to use chahiye ke us ke sath khajooron ka ek sa' wapas kare. Phir Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Samra nahin — kahte hain: Gandum nahin."
"433","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo musarra khareede aur use dohe to use ikhtiyar hai agar chahe use le le aur agar chahe use wapas kare aur us ke sath khajooron ka ek sa'.'"
"434","[AI-translation] Aur Ma'mar ne kaha, us se jis ne Hasan ko Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl bayan karte suna. Aur unhon ne kaha: Us ne use teen martaba doha."
"435","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo doodh roki hui oontni ya doodh roki hui bakri khareede aur use dohe to woh donon nazron mein se ek par hai, agar chahe use le le aur agar chahe use wapas kare aur us ke sath khane ka ek bartan.' Auf ne kaha: Aur woh jab us ke doodh mein kami ho. Aur Hasan ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne isi ki misl farmai."
"436","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Aey Mahdi! Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pichhne lagane wale ki kamai, kutte ki qeemat, bansri bajane wali ki kamai, aur saanr ki jifti se mana farmaya."
"437","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aadmi apne bhai ke saude par sauda na kare yahan tak ke woh khareede ya chhode. Aur aadmi apne bhai ke paigham par paigham na bheje yahan tak ke woh nikah kare ya radd kare. Aur aurat apni bahan ki talaq na mange taake woh us ka bartan khali kare; kyunke Musalman aurat Musalman aurat ki bahan hai.'"
"438","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Shehri dehati ke liye na beche; aur aadmi apne bhai ke saude par sauda na kare; aur woh apne bhai ke paigham par paigham na bheje; aur najash na karo; aur aurat apni bahan ki talaq na mange taake woh us ke bartan mein jo hai use undel le. Kyunke us ke liye sirf woh hai jo Allah ne us ke liye likha hai. Aur oonton aur bakriyon ka doodh na roko. To jo musarra khareede to woh donon nazron mein se aakhri par hai. To jo use wapas kare to use khajooron ke ek sa' ke sath wapas kare. Aur girwi oontni sawari aur dohane ke liye hai.'"
"439","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne mana farmaya ke shehri dehati ke liye beche. Rawi ne kaha: To main ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Aap ke qaul ka kya ma'na hai: Shehri dehati ke liye na beche? Unhon ne kaha: Woh us ka dalal na bane."
"440","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ham mein khateeb ban kar khade hue. To Aap ne Allah ki hamd o sana bayan farmai. Phir Aap ne ghulul ka zikr farmaya aur use azeem aur us ke muamle ko azeem farmaya. Phir Aap ne farmaya: 'Aey logon! Main tum mein se kisi ko na paun' — phir unhon ne Jareer ki hadees ki misl aakhir tak zikr ki."
"441","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Main tum mein se kisi ko Qayamat ke din na paun jabke us ki gardan par oont ho jo bhinbhinata ho' — phir unhon ne isi ki misl aakhir tak zikr ki aur awwal ka zikr nahin kiya."
"442","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne laundiyon ki kamai se mana farmaya."
"443","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne laundiyon ki kamai se mana farmaya."
"444","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo maal chhode to us ke warison ke liye hai. Aur jo bojh chhode to hamari taraf hai.'"
"445","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne talaqqi, najash, aur tasriya se mana farmaya, aur ke aurat apni bahan ki talaq na mange aur ke aadmi apne bhai ke saude par sauda na kare."
"446","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Chaandi chaandi ke badle misl ba misl wazan ba wazan, to jo ziyada ho woh riba hai. Aur sona sone ke badle misl ba misl wazan ba wazan to jo ziyada ho woh riba hai. Aur khajoor na bechi jae yahan tak ke us ki pukhtagi zahir ho."
"447","[AI-translation] Ahle Madina mein se ek aadmi se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo chori ka maal khareede jabke woh janta hai ke woh chori ka hai to tehqeeq woh us ke aar aur gunah mein shareek hua.'"
"448","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo chori ka maal khareede jabke woh janta hai ke woh chori ka hai to tehqeeq woh us ke aar aur gunah mein shareek hua.'"
"449","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Badtareen do bai'en anaaj ki bai' aur ghulamon ki bai' hain.'"
"450","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne muzayada se mana farmaya siwae teen mein: Meeras, shirkat aur ghanimaton ki bai'."
"451","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne do libason aur do bai'on se mana farmaya: Ishtimal samma', ek kapde mein ihtiba', lams aur nabz se."
"452","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rabi' bint Mu'awwiz bin Afra (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Main aur Ansar ki aurten Asma bint Mukharribah, Abu Jahl ki walida ke paas dakhil huin. Aur un ka beta, Ayyash bin Abdullah bin Abi Rabi'ah, unhen Yaman se itr bhejta tha aur woh use wazeefa walon ko bechtin. Rawi ne kaha: To main ne un se khareeda, to mere liye wazan kiya gaya. Aur main ne use apni shishiyon mein dala, jaise meri saheli ke liye wazan kiya gaya tha. To unhon ne mujh se kaha: Mera haq apne upar likh do. To main ne un se kaha: Rabi' bint Mu'awwiz bin Afra par likhun? To unhon ne mujh se kaha: Beshak tum us ke sardar ke qatil ki beti ho. To main ne kaha: Nahin, lekin main us ke ghulam ke qatil ki beti hun. To unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main tumhen kabhi nahin bechungi. To main ne kaha: Aur main, Allah ki qasam, tum se kabhi kuch nahin khareedungi. Allah ki qasam! Woh khushbu ya mahak nahin hai. Phir unhon ne kaha: Aey beti! Allah ki qasam! Main ne kabhi us se ziyada khushbudar khushbu nahin sunghi. Lekin jab unhon ne jo kaha woh kaha to main ghussa hui; to main ne jo kaha woh kaha.'"
"453","[AI-translation] Abdullah ki biwi Zainab se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen Khaibar mein khajooron ke chalees wasq aur jau ke bees wasq ka hissa diya. To un ke paas Asim bin Adi aae aur un se kaha: Agar main tumhen yahan Madina mein ada karun, aur tum se Khaibar mein lun? To unhon ne kaha: Yahan tak ke main Ameerul Momineen Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se poochun. To main ne is ka zikr un se kiya, to unhon ne use napasand farmaya aur kaha: Zamanat ka kya hoga? Waki' ne kaha: Aur yeh saftajah hai aur woh makrooh hai."
"454","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo anaaj khareede, to use na beche yahan tak ke use naap le. Main ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Kyun? Unhon ne kaha: Kya tum unhen nahin dekhte woh sone ke badle bechte hain jabke anaaj ummeed mein hota hai?"
"455","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Raha woh jis se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke use qabze se pahle becha jae, to anaaj hai. Aur Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Aur main har cheez ko anaaj ki manzil mein hi samajhta hun."
"456","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo anaaj khareede to use na beche yahan tak ke use qabze mein le le. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: To main har cheez ko anaaj ki manzil mein samajhta hun."
"457","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qafilon se milne se mana farmaya."
"458","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ham mukhabarah karte the aur is mein koi harj nahin samajhte the, yahan tak ke Rafi' bin Khadij ne da'wa kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se mana farmaya."
"459","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sirf farmaya: Beshak tum mein se ek ka apne bhai ko zameen dena, us ke liye is se behtar hai ke woh us ke liye muqarrar ujrat le."
"460","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Umra us ke liye hai jise umra di gai, aur ruqba us ke liye hai jise ruqba di gai. Aur apne tohfe mein wapas aane wala apni qai mein wapas aane wale ki manind hai."
"461","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tashreef laae — yani Madina — jabke log phalon mein salaf karte the: ek sa', do sa', ya teen. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo khajooron mein salam kare, to maloom naap se maloom muddat tak."
"462","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Najih se isi sanad se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"463","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Najih se isi sanad se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"464","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se isi ki manind riwayat hai."
"465","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Mulaikah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shareek shafee' hai, aur shuf'a har cheez mein hai. To Ata ne kaha: Woh sirf zameen mein hai. To Ibn Abi Mulaikah ne kaha: Nahin, maan, aur use kya maloom."
"466","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Mulaikah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shuf'a ghulam mein, aur har cheez mein hai."
"467","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap farmate hain: Shareek shafee' hai, aur shuf'a har cheez mein hai."
"468","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) wafat pa gae jabke Aap ki zirah Yahud mein se ek aadmi ke paas jau ke tees sa' ke badle girwi thi; Aap ne use apne ghar walon ke khane ke liye liya tha."
